OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain some heavy, turning more showery
OL,7,Flater. Perhaps a few sunny intervals
OL,8,Fover Orkney towards evening Strong
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds developing, chance of
OL,10,Fcoastal gales later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FQuite cloudy with a few
OL,13,Fshowers, though more in the way of
OL,14,Fclear periods developing overnight.
OL,15,FStrong southerly winds veering
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,19,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,20,Fa few showers. Strong south to
OL,21,Fsouthwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
