OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday, mainly cloudy with rain or
OL,7,Fshowers, Orkney windy, drier in
OL,8,Fevening. Wednesday and Thursday mainly
OL,9,Fdry and bright with the odd shower,
OL,10,Fperhaps some rain Thursday evening.
